{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121310","id":4041094916,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7w3jcE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121310","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121310.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121310.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121310","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121310/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121310/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121310/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/83e31a5b04236673d11a9d74956ea329c0ad74e7","number":121310,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"SCons: Support for building shared libaries on macOS, iOS, visionOS","user":{"login":"enetheru","id":1720718,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjA3MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1720718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru","html_url":"https://github.com/enetheru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Building Shared Libaries(mac,ios,vision)\r\n- Add mechanism to generate_bundle that adds libraries from *new* env[\"extra_dylibs\"] to the app bundle.\r\n- Add appropriate link flags for ios and visionos to support shared library generation\r\n\r\nThis is supporting work for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121088\r\n\r\n## What does this solve?\r\n### App Bundling\r\nShared files must be bundled with the application.\r\nThe bundling steps delete the .app folder and copy the fresh template each time. \r\nSo simply copying any compile products to the correct folders will not work.\r\nThis PR adds a step to the bundling function that copies nodes in env[\"extra_dylibs\"] to the app/Content/Frameworks folder.\r\n\r\nAn example of adding a shared library to the list from #121088\r\n```python\r\n    tracylib = env_tracy.add_shared_library(\"TracyClient\", [str((profiler_path / \"TracyClient.cpp\").absolute())])\r\n\r\n# <snip>\r\n\r\n        # Set install name so the engine binary (and GDExtensions) load via @rpath.\r\n        # platform/macos/detect.py already adds -rpath @executable_path/../Frameworks\r\n        # and -rpath @executable_path (so bin/ next to the unbundled binary also works).\r\n        dylib_node = tracylib[0]\r\n        dylib_name = pathlib.Path(str(dylib_node)).name\r\n        env_tracy.AddPostAction(\r\n            dylib_node,\r\n            f'install_name_tool -id \"@rpath/{dylib_name}\" \"$TARGET\"',\r\n        )\r\n\r\n        # Register for inclusion in the .app bundle. generate_bundle recreates the\r\n        # .app from a template (shutil.rmtree), so do not Install into Frameworks here.\r\n        if \"extra_dylibs\" not in env:\r\n            env[\"extra_dylibs\"] = []\r\n        env[\"extra_dylibs\"].extend(to_install)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Flags and Sysroot\r\nThe link phase of building shared libraries does not automatically inherit the flags used when linking the executable, or static libs. there will be linking errors without sysroot as it will search the incorrect paths for standard libraries. and without target flags will attempt to build for the wrong architecture.\r\n\r\n## Additional Work\r\nI believe there is a separate bundling step for ios/visionos that is shared, which I have not included in this PR because I do not have the hardware to test such that he changes I would make would work. whereas the macos changes were developed on a M1 mac mini.\r\n\r\nAI Disclosure: Was used to research what was needed.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-13T02:05:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T11:04:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T02:28:48Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"93e2a43c257c69a2cf447cc75fb8441328fa0281","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"enetheru:pr/shared-libs-apple","ref":"pr/shared-libs-apple","repo":{"id":765566646,"node_id":"R_kgDOLaGetg","name":"godot","full_name":"enetheru/godot","owner":{"login":"enetheru","id":1720718,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjA3MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1720718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru","html_url":"https://github.com/enetheru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enetheru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ene